SDL-E1003 (spec/README.md#design-rules-settled)

  x unknown clause `raw` in table definition
   ,----
 1 | table t { raw: string; };
   :           ^|^
   :            `-- unknown clause key
   `----
  help: `raw { … };` is a top-level statement — in block context `raw` is a reserved word; for a field named `raw` write the `field` prefix or quote it (`raw`: …)
